data: {"id": "585bf8f24fbd4ba2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1392", "run_id": "585bf8f24fbd4ba2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已收到上游 handoff 和预采集结果。先解读已有事实，再执行证据计划中的 Kubernetes 侧查询。\n\n**预采集事实摘要：**\n- **Metrics**: Pod UID `546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`，节点 `node2`。`kube_pod_status_phase=1` for `Pending`，`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` for `ContainerCreating`，`restarts=0`。这确认 Pod 仍处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 阶段，未进入 Running。\n- **Logging**: ES 无日志匹配（empty）——容器未启动，符合预期。\n- **Tracing**: DeepFlow 无 Pod IP，覆盖为空（absent）——容器未启动，无网络流量。\n\n现在执行 Kubernetes 侧的关键验证：**describe** 看事件原因，**get yaml** 看 Spec 配置。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789057669485, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

