data: {"id": "585bf8f24fbd4ba2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1528", "run_id": "585bf8f24fbd4ba2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**describe 结果已经给出了关键事件原文：**\n- **FailedCreatePodSandBox**（kubelet）和 **NoNetworkFound**（multus 插件）\n- 注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`\n- 错误：`Network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io 'unavailable-network' not found in namespace aiops-case-05`\n\n这表明 Pod 使用了 Multus CNI，引用了一个不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition。现在验证该资源确实不存在，并检查该命名空间中是否有可用的 net-attach-def。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789057680944, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

